{# THE POSITIONS REGISTER — one collapsible card per position, on the
   department register's idiom.

   DESIGN → CODE COVERAGE
   source: DesignsProjects/team-module/team/positions/index.html
   | design element                     | type    | source                     | status |
   | crumb                              | chrome  | shell                      | done   |
   | h1 "Team" + subline                | chrome  | shell                      | done   |
   | "Add a position" cta -> #add       | control | anchor                     | done   |
   | Widget library door                | control | —                          | retired: the surface is a redirect for one release |
   | Configure action, last in the row  | control | the shell frame            | done   |
   | section tab strip (.atabs)         | chrome  | shell                      | done   |
   | create card (.dcadd) name + seats  | control | POST team_position_create  | done   |
   | create card: allowed kinds         | —       | not in the design's add row: the kinds a position allows are set on its configure page | n/a |
   | "The tiers" (.pmx-above, three)    | chrome  | static                     | done   |
   | scope filter row (.rgbar .rgf x5)  | control | ?kind=                     | done   |
   | "by name · n positions · n people  |         |                            |        |
   |  · n declared concerns" (.rgbar-n) | data    | cards / holding / declared | done   |
   | Collapse all / Expand all          | control | ?open=none / ?open=all     | done   |
   | card head: mark, name, seats line  | data    | PositionCard               | done   |
   | head: scope kinds (.rgkinds)       | data    | PositionCard::allowedKinds | done   |
   | head: Collapse/Expand + Open door  | control | ?open= / team_position_show| done   |
   | body: chips by declarer (.rggrid)  | data    | PositionCard::grantedGroups| done   |
   | body: "grants nothing" (.rgnone)   | state   | PositionCard::grantsNothing| done   |
   | foot: verb summary (.rgsum-l)      | data    | PositionCard::summary()    | done   |
   | foot: n sensitive (.rgsensw)       | data    | PositionCard::sensitive    | done   |
   | foot: holder avatars (.rgav)       | data    | PositionCard::holders      | done   |
   | empty register (.pmx-zero)         | state   | cards is empty             | done   |
   | "First-run state" / "Register      | control | —                          | design app only, excluded by the design's own comment |
   |  options" toggles                  |         |                            |        |
   | the notes section                  | —       | —                          | excluded: design notes are not product |

   THE BODY IS A PREVIEW AND NEVER AN EDITOR. The matrix lives once, on the
   position record. #}
{% extends '@Shell/page.html.twig' %}
{% import '@Team/team/_bits.html.twig' as bits %}

{% block title %}Positions{% endblock %}

{% block stylesheets %}
    {{ parent() }}
    {{ include('@Team/_stylesheets.html.twig') }}
{% endblock %}

{% block shell_breadcrumbs %}
    <a href="{{ path('team_index') }}">uhifadhi</a> / <a href="{{ path('team_index') }}">team</a> / positions
{% endblock %}

{% block shell_page_title %}Team{% endblock %}
{% block shell_page_subtitle %}Every position, what it grants, and who holds it.{% endblock %}

{% block shell_page_actions %}
    {# THE SECTION'S PRIMARY ACTION, the accent cta, first in the row. It does
       not open a second form: it jumps to the create card that is already open
       at the top of the page, the way a configure page states a setting. #}
    {% if door('positions.configure') %}<a class="cta" href="{{ path('team_configure_positions') }}#add">{{ ux_icon('shell:plus', {width: 15, height: 15}) }} Add a position</a>{% endif %}
    {# AND NO CONFIGURE ENTRY HERE. The frame writes exactly one, last in the
       row, on every surface in the product — a page that types its own draws
       the word twice, which is what this one did. #}
{% endblock %}

{% block shell_page %}
    {{ include('@Team/team/_scope_banner.html.twig') }}

    {# ADDING A POSITION LIVES ON THE TEAM SECTION'S CONFIGURE PAGE (owner
       2026-09-22: add is configuration, a register is presentation). #}

    {# ABOVE THE MATRIX, NOT ROWS IN IT. Super admin and Admin are not composed
       of concerns and cannot be, so drawing them as rows would be a lie the
       matrix tells about itself. #}
    <h2 class="zone">The tiers</h2>
    <div class="pmx-above">
        <div class="pmx-tier"><b>Super admin &mdash; above the matrix</b><span>Tiers and impersonation &middot; at least one active</span></div>
        <div class="pmx-tier"><b>Admin &mdash; above the matrix</b><span>Everything the matrix can express &middot; not a row here</span></div>
        <div class="pmx-tier plain"><b>Staff &mdash; the matrix</b><span>Exactly what their position grants &middot; nothing by default</span></div>
    </div>

    {# THE REGISTER IS A HOUSE CARD WHOSE TAB NAMES THE TABLE (owner 2026-09-22:
       the frame's header band in the design is the register's own header
       here), the filters and the table inside it — as the assignments
       register is drawn. ONE TABLE (ruled 2026-09-22, option B): the People-table idiom — three
       grouped dropdowns, a search, what is shown, sortable headers — a
       two-line name cell (the position over where it may be placed) and one
       fact per column; a chevron folds a row open to its holders. Every
       option and every header is a link: the address is the state. #}
    <div class="c">
    <span class="tab">Positions<span class="src">&middot; {{ total }} &middot; what each grants, and who holds it</span></span>
    <div class="lfilt">
        {{ include('@Team/_partial/_filter.html.twig', {
            key: constant('Uhifadhi\\Bundle\\TeamBundle\\Model\\PositionQuery::PLACEMENT'),
            label: 'placement', all: 'any placement', chosen: query.placement, options: placementOptions, query: query,
        }, with_context: false) }}
        {{ include('@Team/_partial/_filter.html.twig', {
            key: constant('Uhifadhi\\Bundle\\TeamBundle\\Model\\PositionQuery::SEATS'),
            label: 'seats', all: 'any seats', chosen: query.seats, options: seatsOptions, query: query,
        }, with_context: false) }}
        {{ include('@Team/_partial/_filter.html.twig', {
            key: constant('Uhifadhi\\Bundle\\TeamBundle\\Model\\PositionQuery::GRANTS'),
            label: 'grants', all: 'any grants', chosen: query.grants, options: grantsOptions, query: query,
        }, with_context: false) }}
        <form class="lsearch" method="get" action="{{ path('team_positions') }}">
            {% for field, value in query.with(constant('Uhifadhi\\Bundle\\TeamBundle\\Model\\PositionQuery::SEARCH'), null) %}
                <input type="hidden" name="{{ field }}" value="{{ value }}">
            {% endfor %}
            {{ ux_icon('shell:search', {width: 14, height: 14}) }}
            <input class="fld" type="search" name="{{ constant('Uhifadhi\\Bundle\\TeamBundle\\Model\\PositionQuery::SEARCH') }}"
                   value="{{ query.search }}" placeholder="Find a position&hellip;" aria-label="Find a position">
        </form>
        <span class="tm-shown">showing <b>{{ rows|length }}</b> of {{ total }} &middot; <b>{{ holding }}</b> holding one &middot; {{ declared }} concerns declared</span>
    </div>

    <table class="tbl preg" data-controller="uhifadhi--shell-bundle--register-fold">
        <thead><tr>
            <th class="fchev-h"></th>
            {% for column, label in columns %}
                {% set sorted = query.sort == column %}
                <th{{ sorted ? ' class="sorted"' }} aria-sort="{{ sorted ? (query.direction == 'desc' ? 'descending' : 'ascending') : 'none' }}">
                    <a href="{{ path('team_positions', query.sortedBy(column)) }}">{{ label }}</a>
                </th>
            {% endfor %}
            <th></th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for card in rows %}
            {% set show = path('team_position_show', {uuid: card.uuid}) %}
            {% set open = query.isOpen(card.uuid) %}
            <tr id="p-{{ card.uuid }}" class="prow{{ open ? ' open' : '' }}{{ card.position.isRetired ? ' dcinactive' : '' }}"
                data-position="{{ card.uuid }}" data-fold-id="{{ card.uuid }}" data-fold-name="{{ card.name }}">
                <td class="fchev-c"><a class="fchev" href="{{ path('team_positions', query.with('open', open ? null : card.uuid)) }}"
                       data-action="uhifadhi--shell-bundle--register-fold#toggle" aria-expanded="{{ open ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
                       aria-label="{{ open ? 'Collapse' : 'Expand' }} {{ card.name }}">&#9656;</a></td>
                <td>
                    <div class="who">
                        <span class="pmk">{{ card.mark }}</span>
                        <div>
                            <a class="ov-nm" href="{{ show }}">{{ card.name }}</a>
                            {% if card.position.isRetired %}<span class="chip stoff">retired</span>{% endif %}
                            <div class="sub">
                                {%- if card.grantsNothing and card.allowedKinds is empty -%}grants nothing
                                {%- elseif card.allowedKinds is empty -%}placed nowhere
                                {%- else -%}{{ card.allowedKinds|map(k => k.value)|join(' · ') }}{%- endif -%}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                    {% if card.seats is null %}
                        <span class="mono">{{ card.seatsFilled }}</span><span class="mono d"> / unlimited</span>
                    {% else %}
                        <span class="mono">{{ card.seatsFilled }}</span><span class="mono d"> / {{ card.seats }}</span>
                        {% if card.isFull %} <span class="chip">full</span>{% else %} <span class="chip warn">{{ card.seatsFree }} vacant</span>{% endif %}
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td><span class="mono d">
                    {%- if card.grantsNothing -%}Grants nothing
                    {%- else -%}{%- for word, count in card.summary %}{{ loop.first ? '' : ' · ' }}{{ word }} {{ count }}{% endfor -%}{%- endif -%}
                </span></td>
                <td>{% if card.sensitiveGranted %}<span class="chip warn">{{ card.sensitiveGranted }} sensitive</span>{% else %}<span class="mono d">&mdash;</span>{% endif %}{% for x in card.exceptions|filter(x => x.held) %} <span class="chip warn" title="{{ x.label }}: an exception given by a Super Admin, with a reason">lifts {{ x.lifts }}</span>{% endfor %}</td>
                <td>
                    <span class="avs">
                        {%- for holder in card.holders|slice(0, 4) -%}
                            <span class="av" title="{{ holder.name }} &mdash; {{ holder.where }}">{{ holder.initials }}</span>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                        {%- if card.holders|length > 4 %}<span class="av more">+{{ card.holders|length - 4 }}</span>{% endif -%}
                        {%- if card.holders is empty %}<span class="mono d">nobody</span>{% endif -%}
                    </span>
                </td>
                <td class="act"><a class="open-btn" href="{{ show }}">Open</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="foldrow{{ open ? ' open' : '' }}"><td colspan="7"><div class="foldbox"><div class="fold-in">
                <div class="poscards">
                    {% for holder in card.holders %}
                        <a class="poscard" href="{{ path('team_member', {uuid: holder.uuid}) }}">
                            <div class="poscardhd"><span></span><span>{{ holder.initials }}</span></div>
                            <b>{{ holder.name }}</b>
                            <div class="poscardfoot"><span class="k">{{ holder.where }}</span></div>
                        </a>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="zdnone"><b>Nobody holds {{ card.name }} yet</b><span>a position is given on a person&rsquo;s record</span></div>
                    {% endfor %}
                    <a class="poscard add" href="{{ path('team_index') }}"><span class="t">{{ ux_icon('shell:plus') }} Seat somebody</span></a>
                </div>
            </div></div></td></tr>
        {% else %}
            <tr class="dempty"><td colspan="7">
                {% if total == 0 %}<b>No positions yet.</b><span>One Super Admin, nothing else &mdash; add the first one above</span>
                {% else %}<b>No position matches</b><span>clear the search, or widen a filter</span>{% endif %}
            </td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
